Request Time: 0 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Id":20416,"Author":{"Id":284595,"Name":"hirvine83","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":true},"Date":1442107746,"Content":"Congrats on your wedding! The pictures looked beautiful. We are currently looking at Azul fives for our wedding,  I am wondering if you have any information on who their \"recommended\" photographer is? I am under the impression that you don't have to pay extra if you use them, but I can't find any information on them? Also, if you don't mind me asking, how much was your photography package cost? (if it was just for the wedding day?) Thank you <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> ","PostKey":"0a7f2b8f26012a3c8bdfb04f6ee04c8f","CanDelete":true,"Attachments":[]},{"Id":20437,"Author":{"Id":276575,"Name":"reynbow","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-276575.jpg?_r=1424562947","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"Date":1442245644,"Content":"<p>Thanks for your email. And congrats on your engagement and upcoming wedding!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Not sure if you have this website, but it's for weddings at Karisma properties and if you're planning your wedding with their coordinators, Lomas. This website shows you all the options for decorations, flowers, DJ, photographer, etc:<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.weddingsbylomastravel.com\/planning\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.weddingsb...l.com\/planning\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We went to the Brides Dress Rehearsal and got to meet Lomas' photographers and view their work. But we ended up picking an outside photographer in part because we needed 4 days of shooting and Lomas' pricing didn't work for us.\u00a0 We liked Sarani's work, but didn't care much for the work of the other photographers.\u00a0 If you haven't heard about the Brides Dress Rehearsal, I'd be happy to share info. I highly recommend going to one if you're able to.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>In case you don't know, Karisma charges $800 per outside vendor. However, if your vendor is a \"guest\" that stays 3 nights at the resort, then they waive the vendor fee. We paid for a room that was split between our outside DJ and photographer, so it ended up being about $600\/vendor instead of $800. But I heard that Azul Fives doesn't allow outside DJs anymore.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>As for our photography package cost, since we paid for 4 days of shooting, this info probably won't be helpful for you. But our photographer, Pixan, does offer competitive pricing. If you're interested in hiring an outside DJ, I'd recommend Pixan and two other photographers, Naal Photography and Michelle Mercado.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Hope this info is helpful. Feel free to contact me with any additional questions. And good luck planning!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>-Reyna<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n","PostKey":"270cd2a1b2927a1cef8a3f2617c8657d","CanDelete":false,"Attachments":[]},{"Id":20438,"Author":{"Id":276575,"Name":"reynbow","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-276575.jpg?_r=1424562947","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"Date":1442246115,"Content":"<p>Oops, I meant Melissa Mercado, not Michelle: <a href='http:\/\/melissa-mercado.com\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/melissa-mercado.com\/<\/a><\/p>\n","PostKey":"79fa1c79998eb9ddf46d2376b9cf6380","CanDelete":false,"Attachments":[]}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":3,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
